{"id":"05fb51b2-cda2-4458-9fd5-b2e8bcb36c77","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:47:41.008Z","batchId":"settings_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .settings-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.5rem;align-items:start}\n  .settings-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;position:sticky;top:1rem}\n  .settings-nav button{width:100%;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left}\n  .settings-nav button.active{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}\n  .settings-panel{display:none}\n  .settings-panel.active{display:block}\n  .form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}\n  .form-grid .full{grid-column:1/-1}\n  .section-heading{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}\n  .preference-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n  .preference{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem;padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n  .preference:last-child{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}\n  .preference-copy{min-width:0}\n  .preference-copy strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.2rem}\n  .switch{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .switch input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:1px;height:1px}\n  .switch-track{width:42px;height:24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--border-strong);transition:.2s;cursor:pointer;display:block}\n  .switch-track:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:.2s}\n  .switch input:checked + .switch-track{background:var(--accent)}\n  .switch input:checked + .switch-track:after{transform:translateX(18px)}\n  .switch input:focus-visible + .switch-track{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n  .danger-zone{border-color:var(--danger);background:var(--danger-soft)}\n  .profile-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n  .profile-summary .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;font-size:1.15rem}\n  @media(max-width:760px){.settings-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.settings-nav{position:static;flex-direction:row;overflow:auto}.settings-nav button{white-space:nowrap;width:auto}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-grid .full{grid-column:auto}}\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Account settings</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, communication preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"settings-layout\">\n    <nav class=\"settings-nav\" aria-label=\"Account settings sections\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary active\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"profile\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"profile-panel\">Profile</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"notifications\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"notifications-panel\">Notifications</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"privacy\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"privacy-panel\">Privacy</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <section class=\"card settings-panel active\" id=\"profile-panel\" data-panel=\"profile\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-tab\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile information</h2>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Update your personal details and how you appear across the workspace.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Public profile</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"profile-summary\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AM</div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <strong>Alex Morgan</strong>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">alex.morgan@example.com</span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\" style=\"margin-left:auto\">Change photo</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"profile-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <label>\n              <span>First name</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"firstName\" value=\"Alex\" autocomplete=\"given-name\">\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span>Last name</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"lastName\" value=\"Morgan\" autocomplete=\"family-name\">\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"full\">\n              <span>Email address</span>\n              <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" value=\"alex.morgan@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n              <span class=\"small muted\">Used for sign-in, account recovery, and important account messages.</span>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span>Job title</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" value=\"Product Designer\">\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span>Time zone</span>\n              <select name=\"timezone\">\n                <option selected>Pacific Time (UTC−08:00)</option>\n                <option>Mountain Time (UTC−07:00)</option>\n                <option>Central Time (UTC−06:00)</option>\n                <option>Eastern Time (UTC−05:00)</option>\n                <option>Coordinated Universal Time (UTC)</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"full\">\n              <span>Bio</span>\n              <textarea name=\"bio\" rows=\"4\">Product designer focused on making complex tools simple, useful, and accessible.</textarea>\n              <span class=\"small muted\">121 of 240 characters used.</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Last updated on March 18, 2025</span>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Cancel</button>\n              <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save changes</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>Your profile changes have been saved.</div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card settings-panel\" id=\"notifications-panel\" data-panel=\"notifications\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"notifications-tab\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notification preferences</h2>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which updates you receive and where they are delivered.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"preference-list\">\n          <div class=\"preference\">\n            <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n              <strong>Product updates</strong>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">New features, improvements, and changes to tools you use.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable product update notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n              <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preference\">\n            <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n              <strong>Account activity</strong>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">Sign-ins, password changes, and security alerts.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable account activity notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n              <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preference\">\n            <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n              <strong>Comments and mentions</strong>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">When someone mentions you or replies to your comments.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable comment and mention notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n              <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preference\">\n            <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n              <strong>Weekly summary</strong>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">A Monday recap of activity, tasks, and shared workspace updates.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable weekly summary notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\">\n              <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preference\">\n            <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n              <strong>Marketing emails</strong>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">Occasional news, tips, and information about related services.</span>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable marketing emails\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\">\n              <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n        <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"notification-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <label>\n              <span>Email notifications</span>\n              <select name=\"emailFrequency\">\n                <option>Immediately</option>\n                <option selected>Daily digest</option>\n                <option>Weekly digest</option>\n                <option>Off</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span>Push notifications</span>\n              <select name=\"pushFrequency\">\n                <option selected>Important only</option>\n                <option>All activity</option>\n                <option>Off</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Critical security notices are always sent.</span>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save preferences</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>Notification preferences have been saved.</div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card settings-panel\" id=\"privacy-panel\" data-panel=\"privacy\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-tab\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy settings</h2>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your visibility and the information available to other people.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <label>\n              <span>Profile visibility</span>\n              <select name=\"visibility\">\n                <option selected>Everyone</option>\n                <option>Workspace members</option>\n                <option>Only me</option>\n              </select>\n              <span class=\"small muted\">Everyone can view your name, role, bio, and avatar.</span>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span>Online status</span>\n              <select name=\"presence\">\n                <option selected>Show when online</option>\n                <option>Show only to workspace members</option>\n                <option>Hide from everyone</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"preference-list\">\n            <div class=\"preference\">\n              <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n                <strong>Show activity</strong>\n                <span class=\"muted small\">Display your recent workspace activity on your profile.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Show activity on your profile\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n                <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"preference\">\n              <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n                <strong>Allow search engines to index my profile</strong>\n                <span class=\"muted small\">Your public profile may appear in external search results.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Allow search engines to index profile\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\">\n                <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"preference\">\n              <div class=\"preference-copy\">\n                <strong>Personalized recommendations</strong>\n                <span class=\"muted small\">Use your activity to tailor content and feature suggestions.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable personalized recommendations\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n                <span class=\"switch-track\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"card danger-zone stack gap-sm\">\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"card-title\">Download or delete your data</h3>\n              <p class=\"card-desc\">Request a copy of your personal data or permanently delete your account and associated information.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Request data export</button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\" type=\"button\">Delete account</button>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Account deletion is permanent and may take up to 30 days to complete.</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"small muted\">Changes apply across all devices.</span>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"save-privacy\">Save privacy settings</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>Privacy settings have been saved.</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]');\n  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');\n\n  tabs.forEach(tab => {\n    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      tabs.forEach(item => {\n        const active = item === tab;\n        item.classList.toggle('active', active);\n        item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));\n      });\n      panels.forEach(panel => {\n        const active = panel.dataset.panel === tab.dataset.tab;\n        panel.classList.toggle('active', active);\n        panel.hidden = !active;\n      });\n    });\n  });\n\n  function showSaved(form) {\n    const message = form.querySelector('.alert');\n    message.hidden = false;\n    clearTimeout(form.dataset.timer);\n    form.dataset.timer = setTimeout(() => { message.hidden = true; }, 3500);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('profile-form').addEventListener('submit', event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    showSaved(event.currentTarget);\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('notification-form').addEventListener('submit', event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    showSaved(event.currentTarget);\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('save-privacy').addEventListener('click', event => {\n    const panel = event.currentTarget.closest('[data-panel]');\n    const message = panel.querySelector('.alert');\n    message.hidden = false;\n    clearTimeout(panel.dataset.timer);\n    panel.dataset.timer = setTimeout(() => { message.hidden = true; }, 3500);\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[2556,"<style>\n  .settings-"],[2583,"layout{display:grid;"],[2592,"grid-template-column"],[2657,"s:220px minmax(0,1fr"],[2666,");gap:1.5rem;align-i"],[2666,"tems:start}\n  .setti"],[2686,"ngs-nav{display:flex"],[2696,";flex-direction:colu"],[2748,"mn;gap:.35"],[2756,"rem;position:sticky;"],[2796,"top:1rem}\n  .setting"],[2807,"s-nav button{width:1"],[2807,"00%;justify-content:"],[2866,"flex-start;text-alig"],[2878,"n:left}\n  .settings-"],[2878,"nav button.active{ba"],[2897,"ckground:var(--accen"],[2908,"t-soft);color:var(--"],[2943,"accent);"],[2955,"border-color:var(--a"],[2969,"ccent)}\n  .settings-"],[2979,"panel{display:none}\n"],[2979,"  .settings-panel.ac"],[3006,"tive{display:block}\n"],[3017,"  .form-grid{display"],[3065,":grid;grid-template-"],[3069,"columns:repeat(2,min"],[3122,"max(0,1fr));gap:1rem"],[3140,"}\n  .form-grid .full"],[3140,"{grid-column:"],[3167,"1/-1}\n  .section-hea"],[3177,"ding{display:flex;al"],[3200,"ign-items:flex-start"],[3213,";justify-content:spa"],[3260,"ce-between;gap:1rem;"],[3267,"margin-bottom:1.25re"],[3324,"m}\n  .preference-lis"],[3334,"t{display:flex;flex-"],[3334,"direction:column}\n  "],[3334,".preference{display:"],[3334,"flex;align-items:flex"],[3390,"-start;justify-conte"],[3401,"nt:space-between;ga